# Orquestrador — stack

Responsabilidade: **manifestos no disco** → skills. Complementa intent; não substitui globs de arquivo aberto.

## Onde procurar

- `package.json` (raiz e workspaces)
- `pnpm-workspace.yaml`, `turbo.json`, `nx.json`
- `tsconfig.json`
- `Dockerfile`, `docker-compose*.yml` / `compose*.yml`
- `.github/workflows/*.yml`, `.gitlab-ci.yml`
- `vercel.json`, `**/*.sql`, `database/migrations`

## Mapa

| Detectar | Skills |
| --- | --- |
| `pnpm-workspace.yaml` / `workspaces` / turbo / nx | perfil `monorepo` no bootstrap; skills pelo **pacote** tocado |
| `react` / `react-dom` | `react` (+ `typescript` se TS) |
| `typescript` / `tsconfig.json` | `typescript` |
| só `.js` sem TS | `javascript` |
| `tailwindcss` | `tailwind`, `css`, `mobile-first` |
| `next` | `next` |
| `@nestjs/core` / `@nestjs/common` | `nestjs`, `typescript` |
| `typeorm` / `@nestjs/typeorm` | `typeorm` |
| `@supabase/supabase-js` / `@supabase/ssr` | `supabase` |
| `@tanstack/react-query` | `tanstack-query` |
| `react-hook-form` / forms com `zod` | `forms-rhf-zod` |
| CVA / shadcn / `@base-ui/react` | `ui-shadcn` |
| `vitest` / `jest` / `cypress` / RTL | `testing` |
| `eslint` | `eslint` |
| `prettier` | `prettier` |
| `Dockerfile` / `.dockerignore` | `docker` |
| `docker-compose*` / `compose*` | `docker-compose`, `docker` |
| workflows CI | `ci-cd` |
| `vercel.json` / dep `vercel` | `vercel` |
| `*.sql` / `database/migrations` | `postgresql-sql` |
| `*.sh` / `*.bash` no escopo | `shell-scripting` |

## Notas

- Bias quando o pedido é vago e nenhum arquivo relevante está aberto
- Específica > genérica no merge (`base`)
